  "description": "*In a season when cherry blossom petals scatter on the dry wind, I fell in love with a pale faced poet. My first experience of unrequited love was like a fever.\nEach time I suffered from it, I caught my heated breath and quietly sank into misery. Yet that spring was undeniably the most lyrical season of my life.*\n\nBaek Seonghyeon, a poor working student, returns to university with a completely ruined timetable after getting the course registration date wrong. Forced to attend even a literature class he has no interest in, he looks up the course withdrawal period and happens to notice a note taking job posting on campus. Twice a week, a monthly pay of 1.5 million won. Without a second thought, Baek Seonghyeon sends in his application.\n\nNever once imagining that there, he would meet a poet who would completely upend his life.\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1239008524), MrBlue ([Main Story](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/bookpal0787), [Side Story](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/bookpal0788)), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=919018479)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/_collage), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/novel/detail.asp?serial_num=se8753)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1239022034)",
